# NuGet Package Upgrade Plan

## Overview

**Target**: Fix the vulnerable transitive `System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs` 9.0.11 dependency in `UserServices` by promoting it to an explicit 9.0.21 reference.
**Scope**: One affected project in the `Backend/E-Commerce.slnx` solution; preserve the existing 10.0.14 references in the other projects.

## Tasks

### 01-user-services-pkcs: Promote secure Pkcs version in UserServices

Update `Backend/UserServices/UserServices.csproj` with the minimal explicit `System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs` 9.0.21 package reference. This overrides the vulnerable 9.0.11 transitive resolution without changing unrelated package references or the already-secure 10.0.14 references in other projects. No source API changes are expected based on the package API diff in `apidiff/System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs.apidiff.md`.

**Done when**: Restore resolves `System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs` 9.0.21 for `UserServices` without NU1902/NU1903, and the full solution builds successfully.
